            <div xml:id="d653">

                <pb facs="0539" n="457" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg457"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/1335.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Attorney General to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Office of the Attorney General</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-04-15"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to inclose herewith copies of two
                    telegrams received from the United States attorney for the district of Arizona
                    this morning with regard to the situation at Agua Prieta.</p>
                <p>Respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geo. W.
                    Wickersham.</hi></signed></closer>




